        <p class="text-2xl font-medium text-gray-900 mb-8 italic">
          UMAY is one of the newer budget names in walking pads and folding treadmills: it has its own
          US web store with a phone number and a 30-day returns policy, sells on Amazon, and lists a
          wide range, from a $180 vibrating walking pad to a $600 treadmill with a 20% motorised incline.
          That is more than many marketplace brands offer. But UMAY’s own pages do not always agree with
